WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:03.677
Watch and read: How many parts can you clap in the word “pencil”?

00:00:04.533 --> 00:00:08.117
The answer is: 2. Say the word slowly and clap its syllables.

00:00:08.950 --> 00:00:12.641
Watch and read: Blend the sounds c - a - t. What word do they make?

00:00:13.450 --> 00:00:17.205
The answer is: cat. Say the sounds in order and blend smoothly.
